   134→impl<T> SignedTransaction for EthereumTxEnvelope<T>
   135→where
   136→    T: RlpEcdsaEncodableTx + SignableTransaction<Signature> + Unpin,
   137→    Self: Clone + PartialEq + Eq + Decodable + Decodable2718 + MaybeSerde + InMemorySize,
